                │   a desktop environment for your terminal                                 █│                                                        
       🌐        │                                                                           █│                                                        
                │   Desktop                                                                 █│                                                        
      Web       │   F1                start menu — just type to search apps                 █│                                                        
                │   F12               shortcut key overlay                                  █│                                                        
       🖥        │   F6 / Alt+Tab      window switcher                                       █│                                                        
                │   F11               maximize / restore window                             █│                                                        
    Terminal    │   Ctrl+W            close window                                          █│                                                        
                │   Ctrl+D            show / restore desktop                                █│                                                        
       📝        │   Ctrl+Shift+←/→    snap window left / right                              █│                                                        
                │   Ctrl+Shift+↑      maximize window                                       ││                                                        
     Editor     │   Ctrl+arrows       nudge window                                          ││                                                        
                │   Ctrl+Q            quit texttop                                          ││                                                        
       🌿        │   F5                prune dead desktop shortcuts                          ││                                                        
                │   Delete            remove selected desktop shortcut                      ││                                                        
      Git       │   Esc               cancel drag / close menus                             ││                                                        
                │                                                                           ││                                                        
       🔎        │   Mouse                                                                   ││                                                        
                │   right-click       context menus (desktop · icons · windows · files)     ││                                                        
     Search     │   drag title bar    move · edge snap · top = maximize                     ││                                                        
                │   double-click titlemaximize / restore                                    ││                                                        
       ⚙        │   drag ◢ corner     resize window                                         ││                                                        
                │   ─ □ ✕             minimize · maximize · close                           ││                                                        
     Procs      │   drag icons        rearrange desktop icons                               ││                                                        
                │   drag files        drop on desktop / apps · Shift=cut                    ││                                                        
       📌        │   taskbar »N        overflow window list                                  ││                                                        
                │   middle-click taskbarclose window                                        ││                                                        
     Notes      │   double-click      open desktop icons & files                            ││                                                        
                │   mouse wheel       scroll overflow content in apps                       ││                                                        
